    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know what people say about help and support, but it doesnt change the math of it. if i just wasnt here, they could finally move on. they could have their lives back without having to constantly worry about me or pay for my stuff. it feels like the only selfless thing left to do is to just stop being a problem for them.",
